PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E527D

   1 a 0000 E527D: procedure options(main);
   2+a 0006    /* [E2E-53/P3] H-D: stride-2 DYNAMIC read + store b LABELS   */
   3 a 0006    /* already pins both (0042-005E); this probe re-pins them    */
